ec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $72.5m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Net cash of $106.6m against total assets of $2.8bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-13.6% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 6.3% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$481.3m) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1943896/000194389626000047/0001943896-26-000047-index.htm","accession":"0001943896-26-000047"},{"text":"No officer history could be reconstructed from public filings, so the team - the thing that matters most - is the thing we know least about.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001943896"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016